            <div class="step2-reading">
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?>'s Unique Contribution</h2>
                <img class="img-intext" src="/offer/paa/img/mandala-1.png">
                <p>The Magician Archetype is one of the three archetypes who desire nothing more but to leave their unique mark on the world, and the Magician does this through using sheer power to attain whatever goals they have.This power is the Magicians&rsquo; unique contribution to the world for good - or for bad.</p>
                <p>To the Magician, life is all about using their power to make their mark on the world, and boy do they have some power!</p>
                <p>Magicians do not yearn to create liberation to influence the world as an Outlaw does, nor do they seek to change the world through mastery as the Hero archetype does.To the Magician, power is everything, and that&rsquo;s how they change the world.</p>
                <p><strong>Magicians Don&rsquo;t Have To Try Hard</strong></p>
                <p>Magicians literally can leave a mark on their world through their power, and they don&rsquo;t have to try hard to do so. It&rsquo;s just that the mark that they leave might not necessarily be the one they consciously intended.When you have such power, if you don&rsquo;t learn how to use it properly, or stay focused when directing such forces, you can unwittingly create problems and chaos.</p>
                <p>To learn more about the unique challenges that the Magician faces, and how they can maximize their opportunities by using their powers well, keep on reading on.</p>
                <div class="prev-next">
                    <div class="container">
                        <div class="row mx-auto col-reverse">
                            <div class="col-sm-6 mx-auto">
                                <button class="btn step1-back hover prev f-left">1. Introduction</button>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-6">
