                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step3-reading">
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?>'s Sense of Significance</h2>
                <img class="img-intext" src="/offer/paa/img/sun-glow.png" style="filter:none">
                <p>Attaining a sense of significance is a vital need for everybody.If we don&rsquo;t figure out a way to feel significant, we can start to become stagnant, we might develop poor confidence, and our wellbeing begins to deplete.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Most people naturally figure out a way to develop their sense of significance, and in the case ofThe Magician Archetype, they attain their significance through their power.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Most other archetypes have to work hard to attain their sense of significance.And it often comes through mastering their greatest challenge.Whereas the Magician can merely take their sense of significance and keep it - they don&rsquo;t have to work on anything to be able to express or realize their power, and it&rsquo;s this power which makes the Magician feel significant.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>But the Magician is at risk of not liking who they&rsquo;ve become or what they&rsquo;ve done to take this gift.</p>
                <p>If a Magician doesn&rsquo;t master their greatest challenge (which is explained further on in this report), they can create a whole world that is undesirable to the Magician or anybody else for that matter, and they can become unpopular people too.</p>
                <p><strong>For Better, Or For Worse?</strong></p>
                <p>The Magician has to decide from the offset whether they are going to use their power for good or for bad and then intentionally focus it to get the best outcome.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Chances are that the Magician, if they have bad intentions, won&rsquo;t care how they leave their mark as long as they have one.But those Magicians who have good intentions (which is probably the majority, hopefully) will need to make sure that they master their skills so that they use their power correctly and for good.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>A good-hearted Magician, who has accidentally created bad things is not going to be a happy Magician.Hence why this is such an essential factor for the Magician to consider when they are working on how they attain a sense of significance.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Magicians have to step up to their power immediately for they can cause great harm if they don&rsquo;t. They also have to remember to keep their ego in check, because it&rsquo;s so easy for a Magician to attain significance at the cost of others, or through greed, manipulation or corruption.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>With this power, the Magician is literally everything, but take the Magicians power away, and he or she is nothing.</p>
                <p>If you are a Magician, you have great power, but you need to remember that with great power comes great responsibility!&nbsp;</p>
                <div class="prev-next">
                    <div class="container">
                        <div class="row mx-auto col-reverse">
                            <div class="col-sm-6 mx-auto">
                                <button class="btn step2-back hover f-left">2. Unique Contribution</button>
                            </div>
