            <div class="step6-reading">
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?>'s Greatest Challenge</h2>
                <img class="img-intext" src="/offer/paa/img/success.png">
                <p>Magicians have to walk the fine line that having such incredible power creates - even if they choose not to use it.This might sound like an easy challenge, but Magicians have to pay focused attention in many areas of their life so that they may harness their power and avoid hurting themselves or others with it.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>If you have a supercar, you can drive it without using its full power or even realizing that it has such potential. But the inexperience you have or ignorance toward the power can cause you to make a mistake that could cost you or others significantly.Similarly, even if you are aware of the power of such a car, you&rsquo;ll need to practice, and exercise skill and restraint to avoid costly mistakes, and so that you can enjoy your supercar to the fullest.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Full attention, focus and intentional use of the power and capacity of the supercar is required to enjoy such a car and stay safe.This self-control is also the greatest challenge that the Magician faces in every aspect of their life!</p>
                <p><strong>The Magician Needs To Discipline Their Mind &amp; Pay Attention To Where The Focus Their Attention</strong></p>
                <p>A Magician needs to understand that they have great power, and the potential to attain anything that they put their mind and energy into.Which means that if they have an undisciplined mind and a tendency toward negative thinking, well, then they&rsquo;ll create an adverse outcome for themselves.</p>
                <p>In this situation, if the Magician could start to change their thoughts to correct them, or even neutralize them, then they&rsquo;ll move their life into a more neutral perspective (which will be a much happier experience for them).&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Magicians should focus on adjusting their life toward what they want after they&rsquo;ve neutralized the negativity and if they do this - anything is possible.However, if they don&rsquo;t discipline your mind, they&rsquo;ll undo, their efforts or create something entirely different</p>
                <p><strong>Magicians Can Use Their Powerful Nature For Good Or Bad</strong></p>
                <p>As we&rsquo;ve mentioned earlier in this report, the Magician often struggles to relate or connect with other people and can sometimes feel frustrated with humanity in general. This can lead to an uncaring nature when it comes to others which means that a Magician can be selfish in what they decide to bring into existence.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>If the Magician decides that they want to create some &lsquo;thing&rsquo; or an experience for money, for example, and the way that they go about it might harm nature or humanity, it probably won&rsquo;t stop them.They won&rsquo;t care too much about that and will be focused solely on getting the job done.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>This, of course, is a clich&eacute; example, but you only have to open your eyes and see how this has been done over and over again in the world that we live in right now.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>The good news is that Magicians also have the power to create something incredible for good too, and they&rsquo;d probably be hugely successful about how they go about making a profit from it too!</p>
                <p>If the Magician doesn&rsquo;t care about the outcomes of their decisions, they won&rsquo;t need to pay attention to this particular challenge.However, if the Magician hasn&rsquo;t put too much thought into the potential outcomes they might manifest, they could find themselves creating situations, experiences, businesses and so on that have dire consequences even for them.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Situations like this are when the Magician loses their power - they can become ashamed of what they have created, which could eat them up inside.</p>
                <p><strong>Magicians Need To Recognize That They Have Power And Use It</strong></p>
                <p>We&rsquo;ve already mentioned the challenges that the Magician faces if he or she doesn&rsquo;t realize they have power, and then they accidentally manifest whatever they&rsquo;ve focused on.But there&rsquo;s also another challenge concerning the same problem.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Even if a Magician is not aware of their power, they will still have a sincere desire to achieve something or do something with their life.They might even realize that they have the potential for greatness, but instead of going out and taking it (which they have the potential to do) they might feel blocked or disconnected, which causes them to turn in on themselves - negatively.</p>
                <p>And as we&rsquo;ve already mentioned, Magicians need to be careful what they wish for, for they will create whatever they focus on and in this situation, they will create a self-fulfilling prophecy, which can take the Magician into depression, or worse, if it gets out of hand.&nbsp;</p>
                <p><strong>Magicians Need To Balance Their Ego With Humility</strong></p>
                <p>Magicians usually have huge ego&rsquo;s, which is not surprising since they have so much potential. But once again, they need to balance it.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Being too egotistical can lead to an unhappy, unhealthy and disconnected lifestyle even if it is successful by the Magicians standards.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>When you are capable of great things, and you learn how to use your superpowers well, it&rsquo;s all too easy to forget to be humble and to lose touch with some of the most beautiful aspects of life, often found in simplicity (something that a Magician frequently overlooks).</p>
                <p>But it&rsquo;s not just for this reason that Magicians need to balance their ego, for they are at risk too.Which leads us to the final point in this section&hellip;</p>
                <p><strong>Magicians Are At Risk Of Being Used For Their Abilities</strong></p>
                <p>We&rsquo;ve all heard stories of how the rich and famous are used to make money, and then forgotten when they lose their looks or become irrelevant (POP and YouTube stars are perfect examples).&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Many of these &lsquo;stars&rsquo; probably have the traits of a Magician which has been spotted by others and then used for their exceptional qualities to make money or create opportunities for others.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>The same thing can happen in business, relationships, and in all areas of life.So, it&rsquo;s vitally important for a Magician to realize their potential, take control of their abilities and then practice humility in all that they do so that they don&rsquo;t get tied up into contracts and deals that they won&rsquo;t be able to escape from.</p>
                <p>As we have said, as a Magician your greatest challenge is walking the fine line between balanced, healthy and harmonious thoughts and creations versus dark, unhealthy and inharmonious ideas and inventions and also between knowledge and ignorance.It&rsquo;s probably the toughest challenge out of all of the archetypes, but the rewards are by far the greatest, and you have all of the resources you need to pull this off!</p>
                <p><strong>How The Magician Archetype Can Master Their Greatest Challenge</strong></p>
                <p>The Magician needs to pay attention to the points highlighted above and start to build awareness, habits, patterns, and beliefs to correct and align themselves so that they can harness their powers achieve their goals and dreams.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>If they don&rsquo;t, they find that they will accidentally bring into manifestation things that they don&rsquo;t want or desire, which they will then have to live and experience until they learn to create something better for themselves.So it doesn&rsquo;t matter how you look at it, the Magician needs to learn how to harness their power correctly.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>The process of individuation is a wonderful tool that will help the Magician to start to use their power intentionally by understanding themselves better and learning what makes them tick so that they can deliberately create what they want.Shadow work, in particular, is an integral part of this process and you can learn more about this in the Premium Archetype Reports.</p>
